  "problem": "A nonlinear system of ODEs has exactly three equilibrium points.  The system is then shifted using the transformation $u=x-{x}^{∗},$ where ${x}^{∗}$ is one of the equilibria. Which of the following statements about the number of equilibria in the shifted system is guaranteed to be true?",
